  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  img_arrow: {fileID: 0}
  img_bg: {fileID: 0}
  label_text: {fileID: 1123992597}
  text_list:
  - Welcome to the Hunter's \nVillage.   I'm Lisa.   As a \nhunter trainer, I'll guide
    \nyou through the game.
  - ' I  heard  that  you  had \n experienced   a   cruel \n battle.'
  - It's great to have such a \nvaliant warrior join us \nlike you.
  - In order to be a qualified \nhunter, you must master \nall types of weapons.
  - Now what you need most \nis  an  appropriate  wea-\npon. Craft your first \nweapon
    at the Forge.
  scroll_speed: 0.01
